--TEST--
Can loop while incrementing variable

This tests to ensure the optimized bytecode correctly handles the case where a variable is incremented in the condition of a do-while loop without filling up the stack.
--FILE--
var mut result = 0;
var i = 0;

do {
    result += 1
} while (i++ < 10_000);

println(result);
--EXPECT--
10000
